    "name": "You are a Failed Murderer",
    "steam_appid": 3540870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're someone with no life.<br>No Memory, No life. You are absolutely nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/a6910ce58800845d8db88b75b3a569c4.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life has had it's borders realised and zoomed out<br>It makes a screen, one of which you can see the edges of. It's rubber tubing has an incessant humming; It is head splitting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want to feel something. You NEED to feel something.<br>And you can only think of one way to accomplish that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one want. One need. To steal the life of someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't care how, you don't care when, but whatever it is. Don't get yourself caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because\u2026 You want to win this game right? To unplug life from its cables and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a murderer unsure of his life. His circumstances. The people around him. His everything. <br>He only has a single goal, and you're going to be complicit in that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/96df0f46357249ee210926a21c212b53.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containing revelutionary features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Colours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welsh People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;7 Days&quot; Soundtrack as a guest appearance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole lotta murder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And bit crushed cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540870/extras/5c00cc854fc4a80303cde75351004cf6.avif?t=1752788810\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
